  m_text: '<align=center><size=45>How to Play</align></size>

    <size=35>SURVIVE
    across a series of random encounters with Enemies of increasing power.</size>


    <size=35>Send
    Enemies on a TRAP <sprite=284> to turn them into TRIBUTES <sprite=98></size>


    <size=35>Complete
    QUESTS <sprite=240> to unlock a chance to fight against DEITIES.</size>


    <size=35>You
    must place Tributes <sprite=98> in a Fight against a Deity to try forging a pact
    with them.</size>'
